// "Exchange control of <left> and <right>" [CR#701.12b]: if the two
// permanents are controlled by different players, each of those players
// gains control of the one the other controlled; if by the same player, it
// does nothing. All or nothing, like every exchange [CR#701.12a].
(
    name: "exchangeControl",
    kinds: [Instruction],
    params: {"left": NounPhrase, "right": NounPhrase},
    body: Exchange(ControlOf(Param(left), Param(right))),
)
